1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,399
QuakeSense is a working Agentic AI system for earthquake evacuation.

2
00:00:04,399 --> 00:00:09,238
It combines a city-scale resident simulator, jurisdiction leaders that reason and

3
00:00:09,238 --> 00:00:14,077
call tools, an English WebGIS for inspection, and local language-model inference

4
00:00:14,077 --> 00:00:16,716
accelerated on AMD Radeon through ROCm.

5
00:00:17,066 --> 00:00:20,836
The operational question is not whether an alert can be sent.

6
00:00:20,836 --> 00:00:24,607
It is whether millions of residents can reach limited shelter capacity

7
00:00:24,607 --> 00:00:28,377
through a damaged road network, while information, congestion, and local decisions

8
00:00:28,377 --> 00:00:29,748
change minute by minute.

9
00:00:30,098 --> 00:00:34,458
Each jurisdiction leader observes local occupancy, road state, shelter pressure, and

10
00:00:34,458 --> 00:00:35,251
resident belief.

11
00:00:35,251 --> 00:00:39,612
It plans a structured action, calls the simulator tools, and writes

12
00:00:39,612 --> 00:00:42,783
the result back into the shared city state.

13
00:00:42,783 --> 00:00:45,558
Residents then move under that updated policy.

14
00:00:45,908 --> 00:00:48,375
This is a true closed loop.

15
00:00:48,375 --> 00:00:52,898
The scheduler advances time, leaders receive compact memory, the local model

16
00:00:52,898 --> 00:00:57,421
returns constrained JSON, tool calls mutate guidance and allocation, and the

17
00:00:57,421 --> 00:01:00,299
next resident step responds to those changes.

18
00:01:00,299 --> 00:01:02,766
Every decision is logged for playback.

19
00:01:03,116 --> 00:01:07,408
In the live WebGIS, judges can switch cities, inspect shelters and

20
00:01:07,408 --> 00:01:11,700
road tiers, start a dynamic run, and watch the map update.

21
00:01:11,700 --> 00:01:15,992
Orange residents are in transit, green residents are sheltered, and the

22
00:01:15,992 --> 00:01:19,504
side panel exposes the active scenario and system health.

23
00:01:19,854 --> 00:01:22,992
The zero-knowledge baseline provides no leader advantage.

24
00:01:22,992 --> 00:01:27,922
It establishes the same population, network, capacity, and hazard conditions without

25
00:01:27,922 --> 00:01:28,819
informed coordination.

26
00:01:28,819 --> 00:01:33,749
That makes the leadership comparison inspectable instead of relying on a

27
00:01:33,749 --> 00:01:34,646
hand-picked animation.

28
00:01:34,996 --> 00:01:39,527
With LLM leadership enabled, agents prioritize warnings, reroute guidance, and shelter

29
00:01:39,527 --> 00:01:41,174
allocation from local evidence.

30
00:01:41,174 --> 00:01:44,881
The important result is not that AI always wins.

31
00:01:44,881 --> 00:01:49,412
Early safety improves in six of eight comparable cities, while sparse

32
00:01:49,412 --> 00:01:51,059
networks can still decline.

33
00:01:51,409 --> 00:01:55,535
Playback links each visible change to a recorded decision cycle.

34
00:01:55,535 --> 00:02:00,073
Xi an produced four thousand two hundred forty-two LLM calls, zero

35
00:02:00,073 --> 00:02:04,610
failed or unparseable outputs, two hundred thirty-nine thousand resident belief updates,

36
00:02:04,610 --> 00:02:07,086
and one hundred percent applied decisions.

37
00:02:07,436 --> 00:02:09,768
The model also represents physical limits.

38
00:02:09,768 --> 00:02:14,044
Road detours increase travel time, collapse can remove links, and shelter

39
00:02:14,044 --> 00:02:16,765
capacity binds even when information is perfect.

40
00:02:16,765 --> 00:02:21,042
This is why a leadership policy can help early yet harm

41
00:02:21,042 --> 00:02:22,985
later when guidance concentrates demand.

42
00:02:23,335 --> 00:02:27,736
The measured maximum run simulated fifty-one point nine million resident agents

43
00:02:27,736 --> 00:02:30,536
across ten cities on one Radeon GPU.

44
00:02:30,536 --> 00:02:34,936
That is fifty-six billion agent steps in four hundred forty-five seconds,

45
00:02:34,936 --> 00:02:39,336
with ninety-eight percent peak GPU utilization and twenty-seven point seven gigabytes

46
00:02:39,336 --> 00:02:40,136
peak VRAM.

47
00:02:40,486 --> 00:02:45,936
The same pipeline covers Chengdu, Xi an, Los Angeles, Kathmandu, Taipei,

48
00:02:45,936 --> 00:02:49,404
Mandalay, Naples, Wellington, L Aquila, and Noto.

49
00:02:49,404 --> 00:02:54,854
The maps show full-population movement on real road networks, not a

50
00:02:54,854 --> 00:02:58,322
toy grid, under one reproducible agent contract.

51
00:02:58,672 --> 00:03:03,157
Across cities, static access ranges from ninety-nine point one percent in

52
00:03:03,157 --> 00:03:06,419
Taipei to forty-one point one percent in Noto.

53
00:03:06,419 --> 00:03:10,904
Leadership changes early safety, but it cannot manufacture roads or shelter

54
00:03:10,904 --> 00:03:11,312
slots.

55
00:03:11,312 --> 00:03:15,797
In Noto, late safety falls by thirty-two point four percentage points.

56
00:03:16,147 --> 00:03:20,196
Local inference ran on Radeon gfx eleven hundred with forty-eight gigabytes

57
00:03:20,196 --> 00:03:24,245
of memory, ROCm seven point two point one, and quantized Qwen

58
00:03:24,245 --> 00:03:26,085
two point five seven B.

59
00:03:26,085 --> 00:03:30,134
Thirty-two concurrent slots delivered eighty-eight point five tokens per second with

60
00:03:30,134 --> 00:03:31,239
zero invalid decisions.

61
00:03:31,589 --> 00:03:36,719
The AMD path is deliberately tuned: full GPU offload, four-bit quantization,

62
00:03:36,719 --> 00:03:41,849
continuous batching, grammar-constrained JSON, compact context, and a forty-two percent Torch

63
00:03:41,849 --> 00:03:42,782
memory cap.

64
00:03:42,782 --> 00:03:47,913
These choices keep the simulator and the language model sharing one

65
00:03:47,913 --> 00:03:50,245
GPU without losing decision validity.

66
00:03:50,595 --> 00:03:55,481
Validation compares the evacuation-distance regime and departure fragility with published GPS

67
00:03:55,481 --> 00:03:55,925
evidence.

68
00:03:55,925 --> 00:04:00,811
The model reproduces the departure curve, then exposes the downstream capacity

69
00:04:00,811 --> 00:04:01,255
gap.

70
00:04:01,255 --> 00:04:06,141
We do not claim universal causality; repeated seeds and a same-model

71
00:04:06,141 --> 00:04:09,250
CPU versus ROCm benchmark remain next evidence.

72
00:04:09,600 --> 00:04:14,333
For judging, the proof is direct: open the English ten-city WebGIS,

73
00:04:14,333 --> 00:04:19,066
inspect roads and shelters, run baseline versus LLM playback, verify local

74
00:04:19,066 --> 00:04:22,508
GPU health, and open the Xi an metrics.

75
00:04:22,508 --> 00:04:27,241
QuakeSense is functional Agentic AI whose decisions execute inside a city-scale

76
00:04:27,241 --> 00:04:30,253
emergency simulation on AMD Radeon and ROCm.
